que Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Tu ressens de la fatigue sur ce footing ? C'est logique, on arrive en fin de cycle d'entraînement, ne lâche pas mais en même temps prends en compte cette fatigue ! Dors un peu plus, fais plus attention à ce que tu manges, utilise ton foam roller pour un bon massage des points de tension... Bref fais tout pour accélérer la récupération ! :)","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1786320000000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":6.997084548104956,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":328}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"SL_70_HARD_1","description":"Sortie longue en endurance fondamentale avec un bloc actif **FACULTATIF** en deuxième moitié de sortie (en cas de fatigue excessive, douleur, manque d'envie...). Le bloc actif est composé de 4 séries. Chaque série est constituée de 2' d'endurance active, suivies par 2' Tempo, puis 2' Sweetspot pour terminer avec 1' de récupération avant de commencer la série suivante.","displayName":"Sortie Longue & Active","coachAdvice":"Une autre \"petite\" sortie longue de 1h10. On sait que ça parait peu pour certains... Le fait est qu'en dehors d'un prépa spécifique semi ou marathon, pas besoin d'en faire beaucoup plus, on se concentre sur les entraînements du coeur de la semaine !","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"SL","trainingCategory":"road_long_run","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_30","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":4,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Aerobie_2","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Aerobie","value":319,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z3","abstract":false,"slug":"aerobie"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Tempo_2","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Tempo","value":300,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z3","abstract":false,"slug":"tempo"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"SweetSpot_2","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Sweet spot","value":268,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z3","abstract":false,"slug":"sweet-spot"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_1","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":599,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":1,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_12","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":12,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":3,"trainingIndex":5,"weekDate":1786320000000,"status":"todo","nutritionTraining":{"_id":"6a674f79ba18ec460522121a","userId":"642ab60364e5867bee895c04","weekDate":1786320000000,"sessionIndex":5,"choRecommendation":2,"formSuggestions":["semi-liquid","liquid"],"recipeOptions":{"1":{"homemade":[[{"datoId":"fV5sxS6dTOmJgqP6qnmqoA","name":"Velouté de tomates spécial effort","form":"liquid","info":{"quantity":{"value":600,"metric":"mL"},"cho":{"value":36,"metric":"g"},"sodium":{"value":2460,"metric":"mg"}}}],[{"datoI