30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120}],"gear":["weights"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_45","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de ta forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Un bon footing, il n'y a que ça de vrai pour évacuer le stress ou tout simplement profiter pour s'évader de ton quotidien, profite de ton environnement et pense au plaisir simple que la course t'apporte ! Ça fait du bien de te recentrer sur les petits plaisirs simples de temps en temps ! :)","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_45","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":325,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1792972800000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.9411764705882355,"expectedDuration":2700},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2700,"pace":{"value":325}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"Force_A42_600_2","description":"Séance \"mix\" avec une première partie constituée de 3 fractions de 30\" à intensité maximale entrecoupées de 2'30 de récupération en footing très lent. Une grosse récup qui te permet de te donner à fond sur chaque 30\". Deuxième partie de séance avec 3 fractions de 12' à ton allure 42 km avec 4' de récupération à chaque fois.","displayName":"Force + Allure 42km","coachAdvice":"2ème séance \"mix\", mais déjà la dernière pour toi. Profites-en encore une fois pour vraiment te donner sur les 30 secondes, sans penser à la suite de la séance ! Son efficacité est vraiment grande sur ta progression si tu réussis à donner le maximum au début et ensuite te mettre en mode \"compétition\" pour la partie allure 42 km et être en gestion de ton allure !","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_15","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":325,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":3,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"ENDU_FORCE_30","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":190,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recuppassive_2.5","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":594,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":150,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":3,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"A42_12","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Marathon","value":285,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z3","abstract":false,"slug":"marathon"},"durations":[{"value":12,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_4","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":325,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":4,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_5","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":325,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":5,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":4,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate"